quiet.md #27: Window::set_window_min_size

Change a window's minimum content size after it was created: macOS
setContentMinSize, Windows the min_size WM_GETMINMAXINFO reports; other
platforms keep the size given at creation. The window's minimum width is the
document area's minimum plus the sidebar, and follows the sidebar as it opens,
closes and is dragged wider.

